{"id":"f9f1d74ed907c53b","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md","title":"Gödel Incompleteness General","display":"thm-godel-incompleteness-general — Gödel Incompleteness General","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general","aliases":["92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general"],"display":"thm-godel-incompleteness-general — Gödel Incompleteness General","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-complete-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-incompleteness-general — Gödel Incompleteness General"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c04baacf4202d9f7\" href=\"?note=c04baacf4202d9f7\" title=\"92-df-complete-system\">92-df-complete-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\)</span> (formal system in the fixed arithmetic language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem},\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem},\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> (elementarity, consistency, and syntactic-completeness predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A\">\\(Q\\subseteq A\\)</span> (Robinson-arithmetic axioms occur among the axioms of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}general}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\land Q\\subseteq A\\land\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}general}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\land Q\\subseteq A\\land\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>是初等系统</li>\n<li>任何相容、有效且其公理部分包含足够算术的同语言系统都不完备；公理集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>不能与形式系统三元组<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>直接作集合包含比较</li>\n<li>这是Gödel定理的一般形式</li>\n<li>“足够强”不能省略：例如Presburger算术是可判定且完备的有效算术理论，但不解释完整的Robinson算术</li>\n<li>条件：公理集可表示，推理规则可表示</li>\n<li>Smullyan用&quot;初等系统&quot;替代&quot;递归公理化&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-system","status":"resolved","id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)$ (formal system in the fixed arithmetic language, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-7","ta